        <div
          class="variant-size-guide-modal__dialog"
          role="dialog"
          aria-modal="true"
          aria-labelledby="{{ size_guide_title_id }}"
        >
          <button
            type="button"
            class="variant-size-guide-modal__close"
            aria-label="Close sizing guide"
            data-size-guide-close
          >
            &times;
          </button>

          <div class="variant-size-guide-modal__content variant-size-guide-modal__content--printing-note">
            <h3 id="{{ size_guide_title_id }}" class="variant-size-guide-modal__title">
              Important Printing Note!
            </h3>

            <div class="variant-size-guide-modal__body variant-size-guide-modal__body--printing-note">
              <p class="variant-size-guide-modal__intro">
                <strong>(Kindly Read all the notes before proceeding.)</strong>
              </p>

              <ol class="variant-size-guide-modal__list">
                <li>
                  Sublimation imprinting does not allow for white imprints on colors.
                </li>

                <li>
                  IF your design requires white, please order WHITE COVERS ONLY.
                </li>

                <li>
                  Please keep in mind that colors printed on material other than white, may mix to change the final printed color. Since we cannot print white we cannot produce a white underlay to keep colors from mixing together.
                </li>
              </ol>

              <p class="variant-size-guide-modal__example">
                <em>(Example: blue on safety yellow may appear more green.)</em>
              </p>

              <ol class="variant-size-guide-modal__list" start="4">
                <li>
                  Maximum imprint size is 19" in diameter for all cover sizes. (We are sourcing new equipment for larger imprints in the near future.)
                </li>

                <li>
                  Safety Orange Covers work best with dark imprint colors like black or navy blue.
                </li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
